# 🧠 Important DNS Concept

The Domain Controller should use the internal AD DNS service for its domain-related DNS resolution.

The correct architecture is:

```text
SERVER01
   |
Internal DNS
   |
   +---- kpatel.test
   |       |
   |    AD records
   |
   +---- External DNS request
            |
        DNS Forwarder
            |
         Internet
```

This is different from simply configuring the Domain Controller to use a public DNS server directly for all queries.

