# 🧠 Important Active Directory Concepts Reviewed

## Active Directory

Microsoft's directory service for centrally managing users, computers, groups and other resources.

## AD DS

The Windows Server role that provides Active Directory Domain Services.

## Domain Controller

A Windows Server that runs AD DS and provides directory and authentication services for the domain.

## DNS

Allows domain clients to locate Domain Controllers and Active Directory services.

## Authentication

Verifies who the user is.

## Authorization

Determines what the authenticated user is allowed to access.

