# 🧠 Troubleshooting Logic

The troubleshooting process should not immediately assume that Active Directory is broken.

Instead:

```text
Client IP
   ↓
Network connectivity
   ↓
SERVER01 connectivity
   ↓
DNS resolution
   ↓
Active Directory
   ↓
Domain authentication
```

This separates networking problems from DNS problems and Active Directory problems.

